{"strongs": "H0501", "word": "אֶלְעָשָׂה", "translit": "el.a.sah", "root": "אלעשה", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "God has made", "definition": "אֶלְעָשָׂה proper name, masculine ( God has made , compare עֲשָׂהאֵל , יַעֲשִׂיאֵל etc.) \\ \\ a. descendant of Judah 1Chr 2:39 ; 1Chr 2:40 . \\ \\ b. a Benjamite 1Chr 8:37 ; 1Chr 9:43 . \\ \\ c. of the line of Pashur Ezra 10:22 . \\ \\ d. son of Shaphan Jer 29:3 . אֶלְפֶּלֶט see אֱלִיפֶלָט .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB468')\">BDB468</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H501')\">H501</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB467')\">BDB467</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB469')\">BDB469</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֶלְעָשָׂה</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>God has made</highlight>, compare <bdbheb>עֲשָׂהאֵל</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>יַעֲשִׂיאֵל</bdbheb> etc.) <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> descendant of Judah <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:39\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,39)\">1Chr 2:39</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:40\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,40)\">1Chr 2:40</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> a Benjamite <ref ref=\"1Chr 8:37\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(13,8,37)\">1Chr 8:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:43\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,43)\">1Chr 9:43</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> of the line of Pashur <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:22\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,22)\">Ezra 10:22</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> son of Shaphan <ref ref=\"Jer 29:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,3)\">Jer 29:3</ref>. </p><hr><p><bdbheb>אֶלְפֶּלֶט</bdbheb> see <bdbheb>אֱלִיפֶלָט</bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "1Chr 2:39", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 2, "verse": 39}, {"raw": "1Chr 2:40", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 2, "verse": 40}, {"raw": "1Chr 8:37", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 8, "verse": 37}, {"raw": "1Chr 9:43", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 43}, {"raw": "Ezra 10:22", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 10, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Jer 29:3", "book": "JER", "chapter": 29, "verse": 3}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["אֶלְעָשָׂה", "עֲשָׂהאֵל", "יַעֲשִׂיאֵל", "אֶלְפֶּלֶט", "אֱלִיפֶלָט"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": []}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB468", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}